@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = REPLACE_AFTER_LOGIN
@sourceId = REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_ACCOUNT_ID
@destinationId = REPLACE_WITH_OTHER_ACCOUNT_ID

### Register Alice (example credentials only; choose your own)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"alice_sample","password":"EXAMPLE_PASSWORD_CHANGE_ME"}

### Authenticate
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"alice_sample","password":"EXAMPLE_PASSWORD_CHANGE_ME"}

### Open account
POST {{base}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"Checking"}

### List only your own accounts
GET {{base}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Simulator funding (NOT real money)
POST {{base}}/api/accounts/{{sourceId}}/deposits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: alice-fund-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount":100.00,"currency":"USD"}

### Transfer: repeat same key and payload to observe replayed:true
POST {{base}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: alice-transfer-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromAccountId":"{{sourceId}}","toAccountId":"{{destinationId}}","amount":15.25,"currency":"USD"}

### Verify ledger vs balance
GET {{base}}/api/accounts/{{sourceId}}/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### View immutable transaction history (read-only API)
GET {{base}}/api/accounts/{{sourceId}}/ledger?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
